# 统一换行符行为：源码 LF，Windows 脚本 CRLF（PowerShell 5.1 对 LF 的 .ps1 中文注释会乱码）
* text=auto

*.java text
*.xml text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.json text
*.md text
*.sql text
*.py text
*.js text
*.ts text
*.vue text
*.css text
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jks binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
